     "nome": "Minus",
     "papel": "Marked · human · 13 years old",
     "desc": "Alone since the age of four, survivor of three Special Nights — the last one killed the whole orphanage. He lives on the streets of Brasília and has turned his own fear into method: he watches, he trains, and he only acts when there is no other way out.",
     "power": "The Chain — links of blue light that erupt from his right arm and serve as weapon, shield and means of travel. It grows the more he faces it.",
     "flaw": "He carries the certainty that every death around him is his fault. The Illuminated has whispered it forever, and Minus almost believes it.",
     "tags": [
      "solitude",
      "guilt",
      "method"
     ]
    },
    {
     "nome": "Nefeli",
     "papel": "self-aware penumbra · formerly \"Flaw\"",
     "desc": "Neither Shadow nor Light. By her own account, she was born by accident in an Illuminated attempt to create something beyond their control. She named herself \"Flaw\" — then became Nefeli. Invisible to everyone but Minus.",
     "power": "Projects a silver screen of smoke carrying information (Shadow counts, warnings). She sees across the ages.",
     "flaw": "She spent ages without purpose, only watching. She follows Minus trying to find out why she exists — and what he saw in the second he was touched.",
     "tags": [
      "observer",
