      "purpose"
     ]
    },
    {
     "nome": "Luna",
     "papel": "Marked · human",
     "desc": "The second marked person Minus meets in ages. She grew up protected — the opposite of the street. She discovers her own power the moment she needs to protect someone.",
     "power": "Petals — pink petals that form a shield or attack. She ties it to the memory of roses and thorns: beauty and pain together.",
     "flaw": "She calls the forces by other names (\"Forces of Darkness\", \"the Bright Ones\") — she sees the same conflict from an angle that doesn't match Minus's.",
     "tags": [
      "protection",
