      "thorns"
     ]
    },
    {
     "nome": "Red Eyes",
     "papel": "tamed shadow-dog",
     "desc": "A canine creature Minus captured inside the Shadow World. Wild at first; four years of training made it an ally. It lacks old Shadow's feelings — Minus gave it a new name because it isn't a friend, it's a living weapon.",
     "power": "Consumes other Shadows. Obeys trained protocols without hesitation.",
     "flaw": "According to Nefeli, it isn't the original Shadow — it's something shaped. What's left of it when there's no order to follow, no one knows.",
